{"id":"1c2ab0a38c74fb9f","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-assembly.md","title":"omega 集合与一致可实现函数","display":"df-assembly — omega 集合与一致可实现函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-assembly","display":"df-assembly — omega 集合与一致可实现函数","depends_on":["[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]","[[16-df-category]]"],"source":"Definition 1.2.3 pp.33–34 (PDF53–54); Chapter 6 introduction pp.373–374 (PDF393–394); explicit tagged-arrow encoding","revision_date":"2026-10-19","aliases":["16-df-assembly"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-assembly"},{"key":"display","html":"df-assembly — omega 集合与一致可实现函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3665c73100cecbb\" href=\"?note=e3665c73100cecbb\" title=\"16-df-kleene-numbering\">16-df-kleene-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 1.2.3 pp.33–34 (PDF53–54); Chapter 6 introduction pp.373–374 (PDF393–394); explicit tagged-arrow encoding"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-assembly</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e3665c73100cecbb\" href=\"?note=e3665c73100cecbb\" title=\"16-df-kleene-numbering\">16-df-kleene-numbering</a> 的同一 Kleene PCA <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm K_1=(\\mathbb N,\\cdot_{\\mathrm K_1})\">\\(\\mathrm K_1=(\\mathbb N,\\cdot_{\\mathrm K_1})\\)</span>，并简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot=\\cdot_{\\mathrm K_1}\">\\(\\cdot=\\cdot_{\\mathrm K_1}\\)</span>；固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathbb N\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,Z\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(X,Y,Z\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(E:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 等。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\">\\(\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Asm}\">\\(\\mathbf{Asm}\\)</span> 由下文构造。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>范畴记录采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a> 的六元组。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(X,E),B=(Y,F),C=(Z,G)\">\\(A=(X,E),B=(Y,F),C=(Z,G)\\)</span> 是下文对象；完整箭头为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\">\\(\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\)</span>，在固定源、靶的 Hom 中简写为底层函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span>。实现码仅要求存在，不是箭头记录的一部分。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a> 的范畴记录谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(X,E)\\mid X\\in\\mathcal U\\land E:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\land(\\forall x\\in X)\\ E(x)\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\\\\nH((X,E),(Y,F))&amp;\\coloneqq\\{f:X\\to Y\\mid(\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N)(\\forall x\\in X)(\\forall n\\in E(x))\\ e\\cdot n\\downarrow\\land e\\cdot n\\in F(fx)\\},\\\\\nM&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\mid A,B\\in O\\land f\\in H(A,B)\\},\\\\\ns\\langle A,B,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\qquad t\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_X\\rangle\\quad(A=(X,E)),\\\\\nc(\\langle B,C,g\\rangle,\\langle A,B,f\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,C,g\\circ f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Asm}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle,\\\\\n\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf{Asm},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Asm})&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(X,E)\\mid X\\in\\mathcal U\\land E:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\land(\\forall x\\in X)\\ E(x)\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\\\\nH((X,E),(Y,F))&amp;\\coloneqq\\{f:X\\to Y\\mid(\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N)(\\forall x\\in X)(\\forall n\\in E(x))\\ e\\cdot n\\downarrow\\land e\\cdot n\\in F(fx)\\},\\\\\nM&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\mid A,B\\in O\\land f\\in H(A,B)\\},\\\\\ns\\langle A,B,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\qquad t\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_X\\rangle\\quad(A=(X,E)),\\\\\nc(\\langle B,C,g\\rangle,\\langle A,B,f\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,C,g\\circ f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Asm}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle,\\\\\n\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbf{Asm},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Asm})&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>恒等代码与组合代码保证态射条件闭合，范畴公理继承自函数。实现集合允许重叠；实现集合不交的条件另外给出 modest assemblies。原书 §1.2 pp.33–34 (PDF53–54) 及 Chapter6 introduction pp.373–374 (PDF393–394)。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-kleene-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"e3665c73100cecbb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-kleene-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"e3665c73100cecbb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[16-df-kleene-numbering]] 的同一 Kleene PCA $\\mathrm K_1=(\\mathbb N,\\cdot_{\\mathrm K_1})$，并简写 $\\cdot=\\cdot_{\\mathrm K_1}$；固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$，$\\mathbb N\\in\\mathcal U$，$X,Y,Z\\in\\mathcal U$，$E:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$ 等。$\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}$ 与 $\\mathbf{Asm}$ 由下文构造。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"范畴记录采用 [[16-df-category]] 的六元组。$A=(X,E),B=(Y,F),C=(Z,G)$ 是下文对象；完整箭头为 $\\langle A,B,f\\rangle$，在固定源、靶的 Hom 中简写为底层函数 $f:X\\to Y$。实现码仅要求存在，不是箭头记录的一部分。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]] 的范畴记录谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm K_1=(\\mathbb N,\\cdot_{\\mathrm K_1})","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot=\\cdot_{\\mathrm K_1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y,Z\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"E:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Asm}","display":false},{"tex":"A=(X,E),B=(Y,F),C=(Z,G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A,B,f\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"f:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO&\\coloneqq\\{(X,E)\\mid X\\in\\mathcal U\\land E:X\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\land(\\forall x\\in X)\\ E(x)\\ne\\varnothing\\},\\\\\nH((X,E),(Y,F))&\\coloneqq\\{f:X\\to Y\\mid(\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N)(\\forall x\\in X)(\\forall n\\in E(x))\\ e\\cdot n\\downarrow\\land e\\cdot n\\in F(fx)\\},\\\\\nM&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\mid A,B\\in O\\land f\\in H(A,B)\\},\\\\\ns\\langle A,B,f\\rangle&\\coloneqq A,\\qquad t\\langle A,B,f\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne(A)&\\coloneqq\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_X\\rangle\\quad(A=(X,E)),\\\\\nc(\\langle B,C,g\\rangle,\\langle A,B,f\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\langle A,C,g\\circ f\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Asm}&\\coloneqq\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle,\\\\\n\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}&\\coloneqq\\mathbf{Asm},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Asm})&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2203,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-pca]]、[[16-df-kleene-numbering]]、[[16-df-realizability-fibration]]、[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]、[[16-df-eff-topos]]、[[16-df-effective-global-sections]]、[[16-df-assembly]]、[[16-df-per-category]]、[[16-df-ufam-per]]、[[16-df-context-category]]、[[16-df-syntactic-substitution]]、[[16-df-type-functor]]、[[16-df-term-functor]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]、[[16-thm-reynolds]]。"},{"id":"198e3b21cd4c6cd2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}$、$\\mathbf{Eff}$ 及 $\\Gamma$ 采用 [[16-df-assembly]]、[[16-df-effective-global-sections]] 的范畴与全局截面构造。$A=(I,\\rho)$、$B=(J,\\sigma)$ 为Eff对象；$H=\\langle A,B,[R]\\rangle:A\\to B$ 为Eff的带标签箭头。"}],"outgoing":["e3665c73100cecbb","25a281534aa42440"]}